<title>ITALY: Olivetti shares to resume trade on Monday.</title>
<headline>Olivetti shares to resume trade on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in the troubled Italian information technology group Olivetti will resume trading on the Milan stock market on Monday, a spokesman for the Italian bourse watchdog body Consob said on Friday  </p>
<p>Olivetti shares were suspended before the Milan bourse opened on Thursday after a former Olivetti executive had expressed misgivings about the way the company's first half profits were published earlier in the week.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
